{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"西貢沙角尾村一帶停電　中電派員搶修\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-23-00-25-38VaFVW126.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】西貢沙角尾村晚上停電。</p><p>晚上7時許，沙角尾村約數十間村屋停電，部分村屋一片漆黑。</p><p>現場消息指，是村內其中一條電纜損壞，令到電力供應受影響。中電派人到場了解情況，又派出工程車進行搶修，有工人接駁臨時電纜，並在電箱維修，爭取盡快恢復電力供應。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:38.595732+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:15:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:34.612864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:09.963070+00:00","content_hash":"967eb2222e50c079d4acd2e9806ebd41b27968c59ae93a8ef995cbbe2fc9327a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}